नि-√ 1. पा P. -पिबति, to drink or suck in, kiss, Kāv.;
to absorb, dry up, BhP. :
Caus. -पाययति, cause to imbibe or suck in ib.

नि-√ 2. पा P. -पाति, to guard or protect from (abl.);
to observe, watch over, RV.; AV. :
Caus. -पालयति, to protect, guard, govern, MW.

नि-√ पत् P. -पतति (ep. also ˚ते), to fly down, settle down, descend on (loc.), alight, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to rush upon, attack, assail (acc. or loc.), Ratnāv.; Kathās.;
to fall down, fall upon or into (lit. and fig., with उपरि, acc. or loc.; with पादयोः, to throw one's self at a person's [gen.] feet, Kum.; Kathās.);
to fall into ruin or decay, be lost, AV.; MBh.; Suśr. &c.;
to be miscarried (as the fetus), BhP.;
to befall, happen, take place, occur, fall to the share of (loc.), Mn.; MBh.; Suśr. &c.;
to enter, be inserted, get a place, Pāṇ.; Nir. :
Caus. -पातयति (aor. -अपीपतत्, RV.), to cause to fall down, or on (loc.), throw down, fell, kill, destroy, RV. &c. &c.;
to spit out, Pañc. iii, 60;
to inlay, emboss, MBh. iv, 1325;
to fix (the teeth) in (loc.), MBh.;
to direct (the eyes) towards (loc.), MārkP.;
to impute (a fault) to (gen.), Kathās.;
to raise (taxes) from (abl.), MBh.;
 (in gram.) to put down as a special or irregular form, consider as anomalous or irregular.

नि-√ पीड् Caus. -पीडयति, to press close to or against, press together, impress;
to oppress, afflict, plague, trouble, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
 (in astron.) to eclipse, Var.
